# Test Tenant Service API Endpoints
# Use with Postman, curl, or REST Client extension

### Variables
@baseUrl = https://sigac-api.onrender.com
@localUrl = http://localhost:5210
@adminToken = Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN_HERE}}
@tenantId = {{TENANT_ID_HERE}}
@tenantSlug = cour-rdc

---

### 1. GET - List all tenants (Public, Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants?page=1&pageSize=10
Content-Type: application/json

---

### 2. GET - Get tenant by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

---

### 3. GET - Get tenant by slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/slug/{{tenantSlug}}
Content-Type: application/json

---

### 4. GET - Get tenant statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stats
Content-Type: application/json

---

### 5. GET - Get active subscription
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/subscriptions/active
Content-Type: application/json

---

### 6. POST - Create new tenant (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cour Constitutionnelle RDC",
  "slug": "cour-rdc-2025",
  "logoBas64": null,
  "plan": 1,
  "maxUsers": 50,
  "maxStorageGB": 100,
  "maxWorkspaces": 5,
  "stripeCustomerId": null,
  "contactEmail": "contact@cour-rdc.cd",
  "contactPhone": "+243971234567"
}

---

### 7. PUT - Update tenant (Admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cour Constitutionnelle - RDC Updated",
  "plan": 2,
  "maxUsers": 100,
  "maxStorageGB": 200,
  "isActive": true
}

---

### 8. POST - Add subscription to tenant (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}/subscriptions
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plan": 2,
  "startDate": "2025-02-08T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2025-05-08T00:00:00Z",
  "monthlyCostEuro": 399.00,
  "stripeSubscriptionId": "sub_stripe_123456",
  "autoRenew": true
}

---

### 9. DELETE - Soft delete tenant (Admin only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/{{tenantId}}
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

---

