## Testing Checklist

- [ ] Public GET /api/tenants works (no auth required)
- [ ] GET /api/tenants/{id} returns correct tenant details
- [ ] GET /api/tenants/slug/{slug} lookup works
- [ ] GET /api/tenants/{id}/stats shows accurate counts
- [ ] POST /api/tenants fails without [Admin] token (403)
- [ ] POST /api/tenants succeeds with valid admin token (201)
- [ ] POST /api/tenants with duplicate slug fails (400)
- [ ] PUT /api/tenants/{id} updates plan correctly
- [ ] PUT /api/tenants/{id} fails without admin token (403)
- [ ] POST /api/tenants/{id}/subscriptions adds subscription
- [ ] DELETE /api/tenants/{id} soft deletes (IsActive=false)
- [ ] Deleted tenant no longer appears in GET /api/tenants (unless includeInactive=true)
- [ ] Audit logs created for every POST/PUT/DELETE
- [ ] Storage stats aggregate correctly across workspaces

