## Environment Setup

### Local Development
```bash
# Terminal 1: Start PostgreSQL Docker
docker-compose up -d

# Terminal 2: Start API
cd sigac-backend
dotnet run --project SIGAC.API
# Listen on http://localhost:5210
```

### Render Production
```
Backend URL: https://sigac-api.onrender.com
Database: postgresql://user:pass@host:5432/sigac_db
JWT Token: Obtain via POST /api/auth/login
```

### Get Admin Token
```bash
curl -X POST https://sigac-api.onrender.com/api/auth/login \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "Admin@2024!"
  }'
```

Response:
```json
{
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
  "refreshToken": "...",
  "expiresIn": 1800,
  "user": {
    "id": "...",
    "username": "admin",
    "role": "Admin"
  }
}
```

