## Troubleshooting

### 401 Unauthorized
- Token expired (30 min validity)
- Use refresh token endpoint to get new token
- Check JWT secret in appsettings.Production.json

### 403 Forbidden  
- User role is not Admin
- Check user role assignment in Users table
- Verify [Authorize(Roles="Admin")] is enforced

### 404 Not Found
- Tenant ID doesn't exist
- Check tenantId value matches __actual database record
- Try GET /api/tenants to list all IDs

### 409 Conflict (Slug duplicate)
- POST /api/tenants with existing slug fails
- Generate unique slug: append timestamp or random suffix
- Example: "cour-rdc-2025-02-08"

### 500 Internal Server Error
- Check application logs on Render dashboard
- Verify PostgreSQL connection string
- Ensure all migrations applied: `dotnet ef migrations list`

